{
  "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "站在曲面上的一个点，朝不同方向切一刀，得到的截线弯曲程度各不相同。那么这一点到底有多弯？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "高斯给出的答案很聪明：只看最弯和最不弯的那两个方向。这两个方向的曲率叫主曲率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.99,
      "size": 47808,
      "text": "把两个主曲率乘起来，就得到高斯曲率。这一个数字，就把局部形状彻底定了性。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "signs",
      "line_id": "sg-1",
      "filename": "signs-sg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/signs-sg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54000,
      "text": "先看正的情况。两个主曲率同号，说明两个方向朝同一侧弯，局部像个碗，这种点叫椭圆点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "signs",
      "line_id": "sg-2",
      "filename": "signs-sg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/signs-sg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "再看负的。两个主曲率反号，一个方向朝上弯另一个朝下弯，局部像马鞍，这种点叫双曲点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "signs",
      "line_id": "sg-3",
      "filename": "signs-sg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/signs-sg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.55,
      "size": 56736,
      "text": "还有零的情况。某个方向完全不弯，主曲率为零，乘积也就是零，局部像圆柱，这种点叫抛物点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "gl-1",
      "filename": "gallery-gl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/gallery-gl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.63,
      "size": 58032,
      "text": "画面上用颜色表示高斯曲率：红色是正，蓝色是负，白色是零。先看球冠，通体一片红。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "gl-2",
      "filename": "gallery-gl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/gallery-gl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.96,
      "size": 63360,
      "text": "球面的高斯曲率不仅处处为正，而且处处相等，精确等于半径平方的倒数。这个常数性质是球面独有的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "gallery",
      "line_id": "gl-3",
      "filename": "gallery-gl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/gallery-gl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.26,
      "size": 52128,
      "text": "鞍面则通体一片蓝。柱面全是白色，因为沿母线方向完全不弯，一个主曲率恒为零。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "mixed",
      "line_id": "mx-1",
      "filename": "mixed-mx-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/mixed-mx-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.19,
      "size": 50976,
      "text": "有些曲面的曲率会变号。看环面，它的外侧鼓出来的部分是红的，内侧凹进去的部分是蓝的。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "mixed",
      "line_id": "mx-2",
      "filename": "mixed-mx-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/mixed-mx-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "红蓝之间必然存在一条白线，那里高斯曲率恰好过零。这条线叫抛物线，是曲面的重要几何特征。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "mixed",
      "line_id": "mx-3",
      "filename": "mixed-mx-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/mixed-mx-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.72,
      "size": 43488,
      "text": "火山口形状也是如此。口沿处正负交界，形成一圈白色的过渡带。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "egregium",
      "line_id": "eg-1",
      "filename": "egregium-eg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/egregium-eg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.85,
      "size": 61632,
      "text": "高斯本人对这个量最自豪的发现，被他称为绝妙定理。内容是：高斯曲率完全由曲面上的距离测量决定。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "egregium",
      "line_id": "eg-2",
      "filename": "egregium-eg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/egregium-eg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54144,
      "text": "这意味着一只生活在曲面上的蚂蚁，只靠爬行测距就能算出高斯曲率，根本不需要跳到空间外面看。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "egregium",
      "line_id": "eg-3",
      "filename": "egregium-eg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/egregium-eg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.68,
      "size": 58896,
      "text": "推论极其实用：高斯曲率不为零的曲面无法不失真地摊平。这就是所有平面地图都必然变形的根本原因。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.16,
      "size": 50544,
      "text": "第一，高斯曲率是两个主曲率的乘积，符号决定局部是碗形、鞍形还是柱形。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.08,
      "size": 49248,
      "text": "第二，球面处处为正且为常数，鞍面处处为负，柱面恒为零，环面则会变号。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "gaussian-curvature",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/gaussian-curvature/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "第三，高斯绝妙定理说它是内蕴量，因此曲面弯了就摊不平。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
